# Whitelist: only the built site and the deploy workflow are published.
# build.js, generate.js, site.config.js, _src, _live, content, _source, the reports and the
# raw client photographs and clips stay local (the site-security gate flags them as S1 if
# they are served or public).
*
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!index.html
!_site/
!_site/**
_kling/
